	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>. <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et pacem a domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Magnam tibi gratiam habeo, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>mi pater, quod ad caetera tua in me beneficia <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>hoc etiam adiunxeris, quo nuper eos affecisti, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quos tibi commendaram.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quod monuisti <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>me de confessione vereri te, ne <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>caussae communi aliquando incommodet, fecit, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ut de responsione paranda cogitem, si quid <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>eiusmodi forte inciderit, quod non puto; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>videor enim, utcunque sit, ea iecisse fundamenta, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quibus positis necesse sit corruere, quicquid <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>stabilitum volunt.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed de his alias, ut spero, si <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>occasio ita tulerit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><persName>Staphyli</persName> scriptum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ad te remitto, in quo utinam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>multa essent vaniora quam sint.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Idem <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>scripsit alium librum, ut audio, ubi sese Caesaris <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>consiliarium inscribit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">In illo, ut fertur (nam librum non vidi), pleraque <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>commemorat eorum, quae nos hic quotidie <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>magno cum ecclesiae dedecore videre et <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>audire cogimur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Ista tamen nihil videntur <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>movere praecipuos istorum offendiculorum auctores.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Et nos miraris ultima capere consilia?</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Crede <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>mihi, mi pater, nihil non tentavimus, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nihil non toleravimus; hoc <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>novit dominus, ad quem non dubitamus <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>provocare, si ea inciderit ruina, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>quae iam videtur impendere.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Utinam <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>in extremis malis oportuna remedia suggerat <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>dominus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Is vero, ut spero, ita nos confir<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>mabit, ut, quicquid acciderit, coram deo et <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>hominibus possimus diligentiam fidemque <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>nostram approbare, ut sanguis eorum, qui perituri <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sunt, a nobis requiri non possit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale, mi <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>observande pater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. <persName ref="p8111">Martyrem</persName>, d. <persName ref="p8011">Galterum</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>caeterosque charissimos patres ac fratres <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>rogo ut meo nomine salvere iubeas et <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>nostri esse memores.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Nostri omnes <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>te vicissim salutant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Laus[annae] 25. maii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8033">Th[e<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>odorus] Beza</persName>, filius tibi <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>in domino addictissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Accipies ex <persName ref="p8101">Laelio</persName> nostro scriptum quoddam, cui subscripsit <persName ref="p6820">P[et<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>rus] Tussanus</persName> <placeName ref="l327">Mompelgardensis</placeName> cum <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>collegis omnibus; eos excipio, qui <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>abhinc triennium plus <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>minus indicta caussa expulsi <placeName>Valdenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ecclesias feliciter aedificarunt, itemque eos, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>quos abhinc mensem profligarunt.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Utinam hominem bene nosses, illum dico, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>qui omnia illic agit ex arbitrio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Hoc quidem <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>certum est eos, qui primis illis eiectis quatuor <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>fratribus subrogati sunt, diserte <persName ref="p4091">Zvinglii</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z19"/><persName ref="p2442">Oecolampadii</persName>, <persName ref="p540">Calvini</persName> doctrinam iussos <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>abiurare.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Hoc si inficiari audebit bonus <lb xml:id="p2z21"/><persName ref="p6820">Tussanus</persName>, facile eris hominis impudentiam <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>confutare.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Miseret me optimi et benignissimi <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>principis, cui tam facile isti imponant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Eximio Christi servo <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>patri mihi plurimum <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>observando, <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> vere <lb xml:id="p4z6"/>fido pastori.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p4z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>